  "story": {
    "day": 70,
    "title": "Kaya's Photo from Hong Kong",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya usually got up early, and Mom made a healthy breakfast with seaweed.",
      "She wore her white T-shirt and blue pants.",
      "Kaya went to school by bus, about a mile.",
      "At our classroom, Kaya met her friendly cousin, Hana.",
      "Kaya showed Hana a photo from Christmas vacation.",
      "It was her Chinese family in Hong Kong.",
      "\"Whose dog is that with the fluffy tail?\" Hana asked.",
      "Kaya pointed. \"It's theirs,\" she replied.",
      "They talked about soccer and so on.",
      "Kaya showed her new ruler and stapler. \"These are mine.\"",
      "\"Maybe you can interview the kind boss for your club.\"",
      "Hana then bought a drink with some yen. \"Which is yours?\""
    ]
  }
